    CLAP admitted by ports
  * docs: a bundle directory is listed by its one object; the scanner's code
    bundle (#259)
  * abi: bundle_object joins the OMX_CLAP_CORE_0.13 node (#259)
  * scan and host: a bundle directory is its one shared object, whatever its
